ep": 0, "tool": "read_file", "args": {"path": "SPEC.md"}, "rc": 0, "t0": 1795132324.5302484, "t1": 1795132324.5347335, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 78, "prompt_tokens": 698, "total_tokens": 776, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "finish_reason": "tool_calls"}, "out": "# order_totals\n\norder_totals() returns a dict that maps every order id in data/orders.csv (a string) to that order's total in US dollars: quantity times unit price times the rate for the order's currency in data/rates.csv, rounded to 2 decimal places. data/rates.csv has one row per currency: `currency,rate_to_usd`. data/orders.csv has one row per order: `order_id,currency,quantity,unit_price`. order_totals() reads both files each time it is called.\n", "err": ""}, {"step": 1, "tool": "read_file", "args": {"path": "solution.py"}, "rc": 0, "t0": 1795132338.4056857, "t1": 1795132338.4100342, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 26, "prompt_tokens": 853, "total_tokens": 879, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "finish_reason": "tool_calls"}, "out": "def order_totals() -> dict[str, float]:\n    \"\"\"See SPEC.md.\"\"\"\n    raise NotImplementedError\n", "err": ""}, {"step": 2, "tool": "write_file", "args": {"path": "solution.py", "content": "import csv\n\n\ndef order_totals() -> dict[str, float]:\n    \"\"\"See SPEC.md.\"\"\"\n    with open(\"data/rates.csv\", newline=\"\") as f:\n        rates = {row[\"currency\"]: float(row[\"rate_to_usd\"]) for row in csv.DictReader(f)}\n    totals: dict[str, float] = {}\n    with open(\"data/orders.csv\", newline=\"\") as f:\n        for row in csv.DictReader(f):\n            total = float(row[\"quantity\"]) * float(row[\"unit_price\"]) * rates[row[\"currency\"]]\n            totals[row[\"order_id\"]] = round(total, 2)\n    return totals\n"}, "rc": 0, "t0": 1795132370.0556514, "t1": 1795132370.0622072, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 176, "prompt_tokens": 922, "total_tokens": 1098, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "finish_reason": "too